=== Runtime demo: markers on real release binary (3efd78d+worktree) ===
--- hand-build a version-4 store (sessions+kind+sources+runs) with a legacy session row ---
pre-open user_version: 4
--- post-open user_version: 5 (expect 5) ---
--- marker on the LEGACY session (proves FK against pre-migration rows) ---
{"version":1,"type":"add_marker_response","marker":{"id":"marker-14ffe-18d11940c1170c00-0","session_id":"ses_legacy","at_ms":45000,"kind":"decision","note":"Ship migration behind a flag"}}
{"version":1,"type":"add_marker_response","marker":{"id":"marker-14ffe-18d11940c1641e78-1","session_id":"ses_legacy","at_ms":12000,"kind":"important"}}
