{"version":1,"type":"error","code":"invalid_add_marker"}
{"version":1,"type":"error","code":"unknown_session"}
--- restart: markers survive, listed chronologically ---
{"version":1,"type":"list_markers_response","markers":[{"id":"marker-14ffe-18d11940c1641e78-1","session_id":"ses_legacy","at_ms":12000,"kind":"important"},{"id":"marker-14ffe-18d11940c1170c00-0","session_id":"ses_legacy","at_ms":45000,"kind":"decision","note":"Ship migration behind a flag"}],"truncated":false}
